# Prerequisites

## Install Terraform

Verify installation:

```bash
terraform -version
```

Expected Output:

```bash
Terraform v1.x.x
```

---

## Install Google Cloud SDK

Verify installation:

```bash
gcloud version
```

---

## Authenticate

```bash
gcloud auth login
```

Set project:

```bash
gcloud config set project securebankid
```

---

# Required APIs

Terraform enables the following APIs:

```text
container.googleapis.com
compute.googleapis.com
logging.googleapis.com
monitoring.googleapis.com
```

Manual Verification:

```bash
gcloud services list --enabled
```

---

# Verify Existing Network

Check VPC:

```bash
gcloud compute networks list
```

Expected:

```text
securebank-vpc
```

---

Check Subnet:

```bash
gcloud compute networks subnets list
```

Expected:

```text
securebank-subnet
10.10.0.0/24
us-central1
```

---

# Verify Secondary Ranges

GKE requires secondary IP ranges.

Check:

```bash
gcloud compute networks subnets describe securebank-subnet \
--region us-central1
```

Look for:

```yaml
secondaryIpRanges:
- rangeName: gke-pods
- rangeName: gke-services
```

---

# Add Secondary Ranges (If Missing)

```bash
gcloud compute networks subnets update securebank-subnet \
--region us-central1 \
--add-secondary-ranges=gke-pods=10.20.0.0/16,gke-services=10.30.0.0/20
```

Verify again:

```bash
gcloud compute networks subnets describe securebank-subnet \
--region us-central1
```

---

# Initialize Terraform

Navigate to project directory:

```bash
cd GKE-TERRAFORM
```

Initialize:

```bash
terraform init
```

Expected:

```bash
Terraform has been successfully initialized
```

---

# Validate Configuration

```bash
terraform validate
```

Expected:

```bash
Success! The configuration is valid.
```

---

# Review Execution Plan

```bash
terraform plan
```

Expected Resources:

```text
google_container_cluster
google_container_node_pool
google_project_service.container
google_project_service.compute
google_project_service.logging
google_project_service.monitoring
```

---

# Deploy GKE Cluster

```bash
terraform apply -auto-approve
```

Deployment Time:

```text
10-15 Minutes
```

---

# Verify GKE Cluster

List clusters:

```bash
gcloud container clusters list
```

Expected:

```text
securebank-gke
```

---

# Connect To Cluster

```bash
gcloud container clusters get-credentials securebank-gke \
--zone us-central1-a \
--project securebankid
```

---

# Verify Nodes

```bash
kubectl get nodes
```

Expected:

```text
NAME                  STATUS   ROLES
gke-node-1            Ready
gke-node-2            Ready
```

---

# Verify System Pods

```bash
kubectl get pods -A
```

Expected:

```text
kube-system pods running
```

